<p>This page explains the privacy choices available for Simbi: Bedtime Stories and how to request access, correction, or deletion of your data.</p>

<h2>Request account deletion</h2>
<p>If you would like to delete your Simbi account and associated personal data, you can:</p>
<ul>
	<li>use any account deletion feature available within the app, where provided</li>
	<li>email us at <a href="mailto:support@getsimbi.com">support@getsimbi.com</a></li>
</ul>
<p>When we receive a valid deletion request, we will delete or anonymise your personal data within a reasonable timeframe unless we are required or permitted to retain certain information for legal, tax, fraud-prevention, security, or other lawful reasons.</p>
<p>Depending on how the Services are used, deletion may include removal of:</p>
<ul>
	<li>account information</li>
	<li>child profile information</li>
	<li>saved stories and related in-app content</li>
	<li>associated support records, where appropriate</li>
</ul>

<h2>Request access or correction</h2>
<p>You may contact us at <a href="mailto:support@getsimbi.com">support@getsimbi.com</a> to:</p>
<ul>
	<li>request access to the personal data associated with your account</li>
	<li>request correction of inaccurate personal data</li>
	<li>ask questions about how your data is collected, used, stored, or shared</li>
</ul>

<h2>Child profile requests</h2>
<p>Parents or guardians may request access to, correction of, or deletion of child profile information by contacting <a href="mailto:support@getsimbi.com">support@getsimbi.com</a>.</p>

<h2>Verification</h2>
<p>To protect user privacy and security, we may need to verify your identity before processing certain privacy requests.</p>

